Package: svycoxspline
Type: Package
Title: Survey-Weighted Cox Proportional Hazards Models with Restricted Cubic Splines
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
      "Alaina",
      "Shreves",
      email = "alainashreves@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides functions for fitting and visualizing spline models
    for survival outcomes in complex survey data. Includes tools for
    selecting survey-weighted knots and reference values, estimating
    hazard ratios and confidence intervals, and testing for nonlinearity.
